		["{item:6894}, from {quest:1712}"] = "{item:6894}，來自{quest:1712}",
		["{npc:6176} camps by ruins on the east bank of the river that runs past {area:272}, a short walk north-east of the town, just over the border in {zone:1416}; his cauldron stands beside him. Horde: fly to {area:272}. Alliance: fly to {area:271} and go north along the river; {area:272}'s guards are level 42 elites, so keep away from the town. Accepting {quest:1712} gives you {item:6929}, the list of what he needs: 8 {item:3357}, 30 Bloodscalp Tusks and the {item:6851} from his cauldron. The cauldron's {item:6851} is not a quest you take: it never shows in your quest log. Come back with its charms and hand them in at the cauldron."] = "{npc:6176}在流經{area:272}的河流東岸廢墟旁紮營，從鎮上往東北走一小段、剛越過邊界進入{zone:1416}就是；他的大鍋就在旁邊。部落：飛往{area:272}。聯盟：飛往{area:271}再沿河往北；{area:272}的守衛是42級精英，遠離鎮子。接取{quest:1712}會得到{item:6929}，上面列出他需要的東西：8個{item:3357}、30個血頂食人妖的獠牙，以及他大鍋的{item:6851}。大鍋的{item:6851}不是要接取的任務：它不會出現在任務日誌裡。帶著符咒回來，在大鍋繳交。",
		["{spell:2458} at 30 and a {spell:1680} axe, sword or warhammer at 40."] = "30級學會{spell:2458}，40級獲得一把{spell:1680}斧、劍或戰錘。",
} end)()
