		["144 {item:2589} for {spell:2387} and {item:7026}: humanoids of level 5-20 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{spell:2387}和{item:7026}準備144個{item:2589}：5-20級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["204 {item:4306} for {spell:3871}: humanoids of level 25-45 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{spell:3871}準備204個{item:4306}：25-45級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["264 {item:4306} for {item:7053}: humanoids of level 25-45 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{item:7053}準備264個{item:4306}：25-45級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["3195 {item:14047} for {item:13856}, {item:13863} and {item:13867}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{item:13856}、{item:13863}和{item:13867}準備3195個{item:14047}：45-60級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["420 {item:8170} for {item:13863} and {item:13867}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60. Skin {npc:8598}, Plaguehound and {npc:8596} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "為{item:13863}和{item:13867}準備420張{item:8170}：{skill:393}：剝取48-60級野獸。在這裡剝取{npc:8598}、瘟疫犬和{npc:8596}（48-60級）的皮；{skill:393}指南有對應路線。",
		["567 {item:2592} for {spell:2402} and {spell:3866}: humanoids of level 15-30 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{spell:2402}和{spell:3866}準備567個{item:2592}：15-30級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["900 {item:4338} for {item:9998} and {item:10024}: humanoids of level 35-50 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{item:9998}和{item:10024}準備900個{item:4338}：35-50級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["Artisan {skill:197}"] = "專家級{skill:197}",
		["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:3866} (from 85, 2s 50c)."] = "回到{skill:197}訓練師處：{spell:3866}（85起，2銀50銅）。",
		["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:8776} (from 15, 50c)."] = "回到{skill:197}訓練師處：{spell:8776}（15起，50銅）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 108 {item:2321} (1g 8s), 34 {item:2324} (8s 50c) and 98 {item:2604} (49s); about 1g 65s 50c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, Felika and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：108個{item:2321}（1金8銀）、34個{item:2324}（8銀50銅）和98個{item:2604}（49銀）；總計約1金65銀50銅。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、菲利卡和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 116 {item:14341} (58g); about 58g in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, Felika and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：116個{item:14341}（58金）；總計約58金。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、菲利卡和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 44 {item:2321} (44s), 90 {item:4291} (4g 50s), 44 {item:6260} (22s) and 80 {item:8343} (16g); about 21g 16s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, Felika and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：44個{item:2321}（44銀）、90個{item:4291}（4金50銀）、44個{item:6260}（22銀）和80個{item:8343}（16金）；總計約21金16銀。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、菲利卡和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 72 {item:2320} (7s 20c); about 7s 20c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, Felika and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：72個{item:2320}（7銀20銅）；總計約7銀20銅。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、菲利卡和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs {skill:197} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:1346} ({zone:1453}); Horde {npc:4576} ({zone:1458}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3865} (from 140). 150-225 takes about 15s of recipes and 21g 16s of vendor goods, plus 264 {item:4306} and 900 {item:4338} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {item:9998} (from 170), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 2. {item:10024} (from 190) takes a second trip, to other trainers (below)."] = "高級將上限從150提高到225；需要{skill:197} 125和角色等級20，所以技能達到125後，任何一次經過都可以學。只有少數訓練師會教：聯盟為{npc:1346}（{zone:1453}）；部落為{npc:4576}（{zone:1458}）。箭頭會選擇你陣營最近的一位。現在學習：{spell:3865}（技能140起）。150-225約需15銀的配方和21金16銀的商人材料，另需採集或購買264份{item:4306}和900份{item:4338}。把這些全部帶在背包裡再來（按上面的步驟收集，其餘從拍賣場購買）：這些訓練師也教{item:9998}（技能170起），而且製作不需要工作台，可以就在這裡製作，技能一到就學新配方。只要跑一趟，不用跑2趟。{item:10024}（技能190起）需要再跑一趟，去找其他訓練師（見下方）。",
		["Expert {skill:197}"] = "高級{skill:197}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:197} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:197} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:2627} ({zone:1434}), {npc:5153} ({zone:1455}), {npc:4159} ({zone:1457}), {npc:252380} (Zephras Isle), {npc:5567} ({zone:1453}) and {npc:251991} (Zephras Isle); Horde {npc:2627} ({zone:1434}), {npc:3363} ({zone:1454}), {npc:3704} ({zone:1413}), {npc:252380} (Zephras Isle), {npc:11049} ({zone:1458}), {npc:251991} (Zephras Isle) and {npc:3004} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:2964} (from 55, 1s) and {spell:2402} (from 55, 2s 50c). Also learn {spell:1229504} (1s): Forever's {skill:197} camp item, a {spell:2963} and a {item:2320}; each faction has its own. The Camping 101: {skill:197} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a tailoring trainer who teaches it free. 75-150 takes about 11s of recipes and 1g 65s 50c of vendor goods, plus 567 {item:2592} and 204 {item:4306} to gather or buy."] = "中級將上限從75提高到150，費用5銀；需要{skill:197} 50和角色等級10，所以技能達到50後，任何一次經過都可以學。並非每位{skill:197}訓練師都會教：聯盟有{npc:2627}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:5153}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:4159}（{zone:1457}）、{npc:252380}（微風島）、{npc:5567}（{zone:1453}）和{npc:251991}（微風島）；部落有{npc:2627}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:3363}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:3704}（{zone:1413}）、{npc:252380}（微風島）、{npc:11049}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:251991}（微風島）和{npc:3004}（{zone:1456}）。箭頭會選擇你陣營最近的一位。現在學習：{spell:2964}（技能55起，1銀）和{spell:2402}（技能55起，2銀50銅）。也學習{spell:1229504}（1銀）：這是Forever的{skill:197}紮營物品，需要一份{spell:2963}和一個{item:2320}；每個陣營各有自己的版本。起始地區紮營嚮導（完成「戶外真好」後）提供的「紮營入門指南：{skill:197}」任務，會讓你去找免費教授它的裁縫訓練師。75-150約需11銀的配方和1金65銀50銅的商人材料，另需採集或購買567份{item:2592}和204份{item:4306}。",
		["Journeyman {skill:197}"] = "中級{skill:197}",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:12048} (from 170)."] = "仍在高級訓練師處：{spell:12048}（170起）。",
		["What 1-75 takes that the Auction House sells: 144 {item:2589}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "1-75階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：144個{item:2589}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 150-225 takes that the Auction House sells: 264 {item:4306} and 900 {item:4338}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "150-225階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：264個{item:4306}和900個{item:4338}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 225-300 takes that the Auction House sells: 420 {item:8170}, 3195 {item:14047}, 124 {item:14227} and a {item:14504}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "225-300階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：420個{item:8170}、3195個{item:14047}、124個{item:14227}和一個{item:14504}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 75-150 takes that the Auction House sells: 567 {item:2592} and 204 {item:4306}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "75-150階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：567個{item:2592}和204個{item:4306}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包中的配方",
